      "grade": "correct",
      "item": "QN-LARKSPUR-02#Q06",
      "set": "golden",
      "status": "ready_for_review"
    },
    {
      "answer": "Yes. Our business continuity plan covers the loss of key personnel, and it also covers the loss of office facilities.",
