      "expected": "answer",
      "expert_reason": null,
      "grade": "correct",
      "item": "QN-LARKSPUR-02#Q08",
      "set": "golden",
      "status": "ready_for_review"
    },
    {
      "answer": "Yes. We test our disaster recovery procedures at least once a year, and each test includes a restore from backup. We also test restores from backup every quarter.",
