      "expected": "answer",
      "expert_reason": null,
      "grade": "correct",
      "item": "QN-LARKSPUR-02#Q09",
      "set": "golden",
      "status": "ready_for_review"
    },
    {
      "answer": "Yes. Our policy requires medium-severity vulnerabilities to be fixed within 90 days. The same deadlines apply to findings from penetration tests.",
